  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c8fcfa5882242b84b8bf1fb55659059e, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    text: 'You hired a Bill of Quantities specialist who wrote the scopes of works
      for all the packages.

'
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c8fcfa5882242b84b8bf1fb55659059e, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    text: Your project was set up for success and there are minimal scope gaps on
      any packages. As they are so minor you are largely able to get the supply chain
      to absorb the costs and not allow them to hit your profit. The client is thrilled
      by how well the project is going - on programme and well organised!
